<title>JAPAN: Yamaki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamaki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.68		vs	    6.85</p>
<p> Operating	  245    million	  vs	  408    million</p>
<p> Current	    176    million	  vs	  304    million</p>
<p> Net		   76    million	  vs	  117    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.78 yen	  vs	   16.69 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamaki Corp is a medium-scale home center operator.</p>
